  (text "USB-C is for charging, firmware and data offload ONLY while the band is OFF the arm.\nQ1 holds the AFE LDO in shutdown whenever VBUS is present, independent of firmware,\nso electrodes are never energised while a mains-referenced USB host is attached."
    (at 20 380 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "af08c22d-7804-5b77-8605-b7fde1eff66b")
